Why is the browser blank and spinning? Because you completed the TCP Handshake.
You opened a physical telephone line between your operating system and Chrome.
Chrome connected, shouted "Hey! Give me the webpage!" across the wire, and then waited for your response.
Because your code stops right after accept(), your program just stood there breathing into the receiver in absolute silence.
The browser will spin indefinitely until its internal timer runs out and it throws a ERR_EMPTY_RESPONSE crash.



